Hat's shoes for a sec.

57
00:03:38,940 --> 00:03:42,528
He's not supposed to rendezvous
with his crewmates until 1am.

58
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:46,520
In other words, even if he
wasn't expecting an ambush,

59
00:03:46,760 --> 00:03:48,657
there's no point in coming early.

60
00:03:48,740 --> 00:03:51,622
He can't win the fight,
but he can capture Barrel.

61
00:03:51,780 --> 00:03:53,857
And she's the key to
the mirror world, right?

62
00:03:53,940 --> 00:03:54,881
So he grabs her,

63
