let's try to stay sharp.

76
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:31,660
We don't mind if you
come early, Straw Hat.

77
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:34,780
My sickle can't wait to meet your neck.

78
00:04:53,140 --> 00:04:56,316
They're armed, meaning they're
pirates, not civilians.

79
00:04:56,680 --> 00:05:01,209
Must have broken all the other mirrors,
so Luffy has to come out of that one.

80
00:05:03,400 --> 00:05:06,518
The second he shows, we're
going to have to haul ass.

81
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:08,748
Otherwise, we're both dead.

82
00:05:11,640 --> 00:05:16,287
I'm going to be in a hurry, so we might
need to say our goodbyes soon, Pudding.

83
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:17,310
That okay?

84
00:05:20,200 --> 00:05:22,259
Why are you all the way over there?

85
00:05:22,980 --> 00:05:25,257
I happen to like it over here, that's all.

86
00:05:25,340 --> 00:05:28,281
And for the record, I can
hear you perfectly fine.

87
00:05:28,500 --> 00:05:29,330
Fudgy.

88
00:05:29,540 --> 00:05:30,370
Dear.

89
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:37,240
Thinking back, it was pretty
funny how we met, huh?

90
00:05:43,520 --> 00:05:45,820
This is your fiancé, Lili.

91
00:05:46,080 --> 00:05:47,640
Lady Charlotte Pudding.

92
00:05:49,060 --> 00:05:51,140
I want us to get married tomorrow.

93
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:59,769
I know we weren't together for
long, but I had a lot of fun.

94
00:05:59,940 --> 00:06:01,234
I'll never forget you.

95
00:06:02,080 --> 00:06:03,620
Thank you for everything.

96
