227
00:18:20,740 --> 00:18:22,916
Maintain our distance from the shore!

228
00:18:23,020 --> 00:18:24,420
Seems wise to me.

229
00:18:29,580 --> 00:18:30,410
Smoothie?

230
00:18:30,493 --> 00:18:31,732
So what's our next move?

231
00:18:32,080 --> 00:18:33,021
They're trapped.

232
00:18:33,220 --> 00:18:34,917
We don't need to rush into this.

233
00:18:35,000 --> 00:18:37,941
We'll simply support the
main force from the rear.

234
00:18:38,180 --> 00:18:42,240
The Totoland Grand Fleet, led by
Snap, is immediately ahead of them.

235
00:18:42,600 --> 00:18:46,247
With us to their rear, they don't
have an inch of wiggle room.

236
00:18:46,600 --> 00:18:49,718
They're doomed even if they
do make it to the island.

237
00:18:50,560 --> 00:18:53,795
Oven has a massive army ready
and waiting to kill them.

238
00:18:54,900 --> 00:18:57,460
Whatever they do next is inconsequential.

239
00:18:58,740 --> 00:19:00,940
This is the end of the line for them.

240
00:19:03,420 --> 00:19:05,891
Keep all the transponder snails connected.

241
00:19:06,200 --> 00:19:08,140
We need intel from every angle.

242
00:19:08,360 --> 00:19:10,337
I want to give them a crushing defeat.

243
00:19:10,420 --> 00:19:12,714
As you wish, sir, I'll keep you posted.

244
00:19:14,760 --> 00:19:17,113
I hope you're saying your prayers, brat.

245
00:19:18,220 --> 00:19:19,680
Stop making us wait.

246
00:19:19,880 --> 00:19:21,080
Come out and fight!

247
00:19:29,780 --> 00:19:32,700
Luffy, come on. Hurry.

248
00:19:39,920 --> 00:19:41,497
Somebody. Anybody.

249
00:19:41,580 --> 00:19:43,120
You gotta help me.

250
