When a mink stares at a full moon, then
they turn Sulong and wield incredible power.

255
00:19:53,380 --> 00:19:55,380
Unfortunately, I'm not good at it.

256
00:19:55,520 --> 00:19:57,360
I'll rather at controlling it.

257
00:19:57,860 --> 00:19:59,977
The transforming part I can do just fine.

258
00:20:00,060 --> 00:20:02,517
But I'll become nothing
more than a raging beast.

259
00:20:02,600 --> 00:20:04,320
And then what? Mayhem.

260
00:20:04,540 --> 00:20:07,893
I'll start running wild and
destroy everything around me.

261
00:20:08,260 --> 00:20:11,540
Nobody can reach me once
I'm like that. Not anymore.

262
00:20:12,680 --> 00:20:16,057
Because there's only one man
who could save me from myself.

263
00:20:16,140 --> 00:20:17,780
And that's big bro Pedro!

264
00:20:18,360 --> 00:20:19,220
Get out!

265
00:20:33,920 --> 00:20:35,020
Pec-Holmes!

266
00:20:35,220 --> 00:20:36,140
That's enough!

267
00:20:36,420 --> 00:20:39,497
There was just something about
his voice that calmed me down.

268
00:20:39,580 --> 00:20:44,051
He could always bring me back from the
edge before I completely lost myself.

269
00:20:49,160 --> 00:20:49,990
Pedro.

270
00:20:51,560 --> 00:20:52,390
No.

271
00:20:52,820 --> 00:20:57,526
Whenever I transform, there won't be
anyone left who can reach me in that state.

272
00:20:57,620 --> 00:20:58,450
Get up!

273
00:20:59,120 --> 00:21:02,060
Listen, there's a full
moon tonight, Straw Hat.

274
00:21:07,480 --> 00:21:12,060
So when I go through this mirror
to Kaku Island, I'll transform.

275
00:21:12,500 --> 00:21:14,300
And then all bets are off!

276
00:21:14,900 --> 00:21:17,640
When I'm going on a
rampage in my Sulong form,

277
00:21:18,080 --> 00:21:20,457
that'll be your chance to
escape from Kaku Island.

278
00:21:20,540 --> 00:21:21,800
You idiot.

279
00:21:22,180 --> 00:21:23,800
That plan'll never work.

280
00:21:24,020 --> 00:21:25,200
They'll butcher you.

281
00:21:25,680 --> 00:21:29,680
Look, the force of Cacao Island is
big enough to launch a whole war.

282
00:21:29,800 --> 00:21:34,329
Even if you transform, they'll cut you
down like the traitorous fool you are.

283
00:21:35,800 --> 00:21:37,020
Don't drop me!

284
00:21:38,940 --> 00:21:41,037
Cannon, we're not listening to you!

285
00:21:41,120 --> 00:21:43,238
Straw Hat will be there in a second!

286
00:21:44,020 --> 00:21:46,667
Don't you dare forget
what Pedro did for you.

287
00:21:46,760 --> 00:21:49,980
You cannot let his
sacrifice be made! Get out!

288
00:21:53,940 --> 00:21:55,320
Thanks, Peckums.

289
00:21:56,300 --> 00:21:57,700
I promise.

290
00:21:58,440 --> 00:21:59,270
Right.

291
00:21:59,353 --> 00:22:00,908
Now it's your turn brewing.

292
00:22:01,660 --> 00:22:02,490
Huh?

293
00:22:02,573 --> 00:22:04,540
Here we go!

294
00:22:13,540 --> 00:22:15,477
It's coming from inside the mirror.

295
00:22:15,560 --> 00:22:17,300
Someone help me!

296
00:22:19,220 --> 00:22:21,657
That totally sounds like Barrel,

297
00:22:21,740 --> 00:22:24,937
as I thought she was captured
and used by Straw Hat.

298
00:22:25,020 --> 00:22:26,300
He will pay.

299
00:22:33,120 --> 00:22:36,420
He's coming aim and fire! Why?

300
00:22:53,020 --> 00:22:54,080
That's strange.

301
00:23:00,020 --> 00:23:02,260
My name's Miss Hampec Holmes.

302
00:23:02,540 --> 00:23:04,716
You had better start talking or else.

303
00:23:08,220 --> 00:23:09,657
Wait, get back!

304
00:23:09,740 --> 00:23:14,437
Don't you dare move an inch—you try any
funny business and you'll regret it.

305
00:23:14,520 --> 00:23:18,777
You hear me—this gun ain't no joy, don't
you think I will blow her brains out?

306
00:23:18,860 --> 00:23:19,690
Get off!

307
00:23:19,773 --> 00:23:20,603
Please put

308
00:23:22,040 --> 00:23:23,837
the gun down—are you crazy?

309
00:23:23,920 --> 00:23:26,337
Hey, Pecos, what are you trying to pull?

310
00:23:26,420 --> 00:23:28,357
Let's calm down and talk this out.

311
00:23:28,440 --> 00:23:29,577
What's wrong with you?

312
00:23:29,660 --> 00:23:30,757
Let her go—don't kill me.

313
00:23:30,840 --> 00:23:32,137
Have mercy!

314
00:23:32,220 --> 00:23:34,640
kill me have mercy

315
00:23:36,900 --> 00:23:41,724
This disguise was pointless, since they'd
know who I was as soon as I transformed.

316
00:23:44,160 --> 00:23:45,820
No turning back now.

317
00:23:55,400 --> 00:23:59,047
I will protect Straw Hat with
every last ounce of my strength,

318
00:23:59,140 --> 00:24:03,480
because he is the man that Big
Brother Pedro put his life on!

319
00:24:15,200 --> 00:24:16,380
You're kidding me!

320
00:24:19,420 --> 00:24:21,237
Whoa, he's too long for him, huh?

321
00:24:21,320 --> 00:24:22,797
Come on, Pestle, don't do it!

322
00:24:22,880 --> 00:24:25,939
You're gonna flip out and
get all of us killed, man!

323
00:24:26,580 --> 00:24:28,360
Get away from here!

324
00:24:30,460 --> 00:24:31,640
Hold him back!

325
00:24:32,280 --> 00:24:33,777
It's too late now.

326
00:24:33,860 --> 00:24:35,700
Prepare yourselves!

327
00:24:37,240 --> 00:24:38,070
Hey!

328
00:24:38,300 --> 00:24:39,200
Cut it out!

329
00:24:40,820 --> 00:24:42,100
What the hell?

330
00:24:42,500 --> 00:24:46,117
I expected Straw Hat or at least
Katakuri to come out of the

331
00:24:46,200 --> 00:24:49,597
mirror and instead I get to deal
with this deranged circus freak!

332
00:24:49,680 --> 00:24:52,386
You have no right to
point a gun at my sister!

333
00:24:52,620 --> 00:24:54,660
So put that damn thing down!

334
00:24:59,680 --> 00:25:00,900
He got me!

335
00:25:04,440 --> 00:25:05,740
It's...

336
00:25:07,160 --> 00:25:07,990
Weeding!

337
00:25:12,360 --> 00:25:13,190
Yay!

338
00:25:13,420 --> 00:25:14,340
That was cool!

339
00:25:21,660 --> 00:25:22,960
It's Straw Hat!

340
00:25:29,460 --> 00:25:30,760
Luffy...

341
00:25:34,640 --> 00:25:35,470
Please!

342
00:25:37,020 --> 00:25:39,037
Better, better, better, better, better.

343
00:25:39,120 --> 00:25:39,950
Click.

344
00:25:40,380 --> 00:25:43,260
Can you hear me? Yes, Angie! Good news.

345
00:25:44,380 --> 00:25:45,210
Luffy's here.

346
00:25:54,620 --> 00:25:55,620
It's Straw Hat!

347
00:25:55,960 --> 00:25:57,372
Petcombs was hiding him.

348
00:25:57,740 --> 00:25:58,720
Let's get him!

349
00:25:59,940 --> 00:26:02,877
He must have tricked Katakuri
and made a run for it.

350
00:26:02,960 --> 00:26:04,940
Pretty impressive, actually.

351
00:26:05,320 --> 00:26:06,560
Me first!

352
00:26:11,320 --> 00:26:12,580
He's up there!

353
00:26:14,680 --> 00:26:16,900
Straw Hat, why'd you jump?

354
00:26:17,200 --> 00:26:19,660
You're an easy target, up here.

355
00:26:22,740 --> 00:26:24,260
Just surrender!

356
00:26:29,760 --> 00:26:31,417
Big Brother Raisin!

357
00:26:31,500 --> 00:26:33,840
Who's helping out Straw Hat?

358
00:26:34,860 --> 00:26:35,690
Sanchi!

359
00:26:36,500 --> 00:26:37,540
Win your fight?

360
00:26:38,240 --> 00:26:39,070
Uh-huh!

361
00:26:41,820 --> 00:26:44,000
Heh, I knew he would.

362
00:26:44,760 --> 00:26:46,657
They're trying to escape through the air!

363
00:26:46,740 --> 00:26:47,681
That's Blackleg!

364
00:26:49,080 --> 00:26:49,910
Foolish.

365
00:26:50,060 --> 00:26:51,340
Easy to counter.

366
00:26:51,900 --> 00:26:53,157
You think you're special?

367
00:26:53,240 --> 00:26:55,560
We could use Gippo too, dummy! One!

368
00:26:56,140 --> 00:26:56,970
Two!

369
00:26:57,420 --> 00:26:58,250
Three!

370
00:26:58,480 --> 00:26:59,310
Four!

371
00:27:07,200 --> 00:27:10,200
Make it so he'll never
see the full moon again.

372
00:27:38,480 --> 00:27:39,740
Peckhams, no!

373
00:27:41,060 --> 00:27:42,920
Are you ignoring me?

374
00:27:44,500 --> 00:27:46,100
How rude!

375
00:27:53,300 --> 00:27:55,140
Struggle as hard as you like.

376
00:27:55,460 --> 00:27:57,977
No one can overcome this many foes.

377
00:27:58,060 --> 00:28:00,980
Surely even you must realize it by now.

378
00:28:03,140 --> 00:28:04,240
Damn it.

379
00:28:05,180 --> 00:28:06,010
Hmm.

380
00:28:10,220 --> 00:28:12,400
There's an explosion at the harbor!

381
00:28:14,680 --> 00:28:17,040
Damn it! What now?

382
00:28:17,520 --> 00:28:20,040
Well, what just happened to me?

383
00:28:20,540 --> 00:28:22,952
The ships near the shore are all burning.

384
00:28:23,480 --> 00:28:24,700
What happened?

385
00:28:25,100 --> 00:28:26,197
Is this a bombing?

386
00:28:26,280 --> 00:28:30,000
They've got an entire fleet
of snacks, sir! Who are they?

387
00:28:30,400 --> 00:28:32,077
It seems to be...

388
00:28:32,160 --> 00:28:33,360
Jerobo Double Six!

389
00:28:35,080 --> 00:28:36,220
What the hell?

390
00:28:36,500 --> 00:28:38,147
I thought we wiped them out!

391
00:28:38,260 --> 00:28:39,700
Was that report a lie?

392
00:28:40,540 --> 00:28:41,480
Next round!

393
00:28:41,800 --> 00:28:42,741
Prepare to fire!

394
00:28:43,260 --> 00:28:44,600
Jerobo Double Six!

395
00:28:54,420 --> 00:28:55,500
Open fire!

396
00:29:08,640 --> 00:29:10,400
German Devil Six.

397
00:29:11,000 --> 00:29:13,800
You owe us after that tea party.

398
00:29:14,100 --> 00:29:16,180
And you'll pay with interest.

399
00:29:16,740 --> 00:29:18,780
Don't test your luck with me!

400
00:29:19,500 --> 00:29:21,340
Did you come to help us?

401
00:29:22,020 --> 00:29:24,000
Oh, Sanji, you're here.

402
00:29:31,500 --> 00:29:33,760
We stopped by to crush these fools.

403
00:29:34,720 --> 00:29:36,544
Can't let you have all the fun.
